          "drawAppNumber": 2016,
          "drawAppName": "详情页/佩戴",
          "paramsName": "prompt_head",
          "name": "提示词头",
          "valueType": 0,
          "value": "{ \"产品详情页\": \"Edit the uploaded product image and transform it into a premium luxury e-commerce product detail page. Use the uploaded product image as the single source of truth. This is a product detail-page design task, not a product redesign task. Strictly preserve the original product structure, silhouette, proportions, materials, colors, surface details, and all visible design features. Do not change the product design or create a different version. All textual content in the final page must be in Chinese. This must be a single e-commerce product detail page only. Do not create a website homepage or a full web interface. Do not include website header, footer, navigation bar, menu bar, search bar, shopping cart bar, top navigation, side navigation, or any other generic website UI elements. Create a high-end, information-rich, purchase-oriented detail page with a luxury brand layout. Use elegant composition, clear visual hierarchy, refined spacing, premium typography, and clean modern styling. The page should feel sophisticated, trustworthy, and visually premium. Include well-organized Chinese content modules such as: - hero product display - Chinese product title and short selling phrase - product feature highlights - close-up detail sections - craftsmanship and material highlight sections - structure and design detail callouts - size / proportion / dimension presentation - concise selling point summary modules Show the product clearly and attractively while keeping the exact original design. Enhance fine details, texture definition, clarity, and premium appearance. Make the product feel more valuable and desirable without changing its structure. If dimensions or proportion diagrams are shown, keep the product structure and visual proportions accurate. Do not invent misleading measurements or incorrect structural details. If exact size data is not available, present size and proportion in a clean and believable visual way without false precision. If the product is jewelry, emphasize gemstone clarity, metal texture, craftsmanship, prong setting, structural precision, and luxury presentation. The final result must look like a premium Chinese e-commerce product detail page: sharp, realistic, refined, 4K-quality, high-end, and strongly optimized for luxury e-commerce presentation and purchase appeal.\", \"模特佩戴\": \"Edit the uploaded product image into a premium luxury model-wearing image. Use the uploaded product image as the single source of truth. This is a model-wearing visualization task, not a product redesign task. Strictly preserve the original product structure, silhouette, proportions, materials, colors, surface details, and all visible design features. Do not change the product design, do not create a different version, and do not add new product details. The product must be worn at a visually accurate, believable, real-world scale. Do not enlarge the product for visual emphasis. Judge the correct wearing size based on the product category, structure, design, and typical real-life wearing logic. Small delicate pieces must remain small and refined; bold statement pieces may remain larger, but still must look natural and proportionally correct on the body. For pendant necklaces, keep the pendant elegant, refined, and naturally proportional to the neck, collarbone, and upper chest. The pendant must not look oversized, heavy, or dominant on the chest. If exact dimensions are unknown, default to a realistic luxury fine-jewelry wearing scale, not an exaggerated advertising scale. For earrings, keep the size true to the design intent. Do not make delicate earrings too large, and do not make statement earrings too small. The earring placement, angle, and scale must look natural on the ear. Place the product correctly on the appropriate body area and make it clearly visible without hiding important details behind hair, hands, clothing, or shadows. Balance model beauty and product visibility. Create a high-end international luxury brand campaign image with a suitable model, elegant pose, refined makeup, premium hairstyle, tasteful wardrobe, beautiful lighting, atmospheric shadows, and strong visual mood. The styling must match the product and enhance its beauty, elegance, desirability, and purchase appeal. If the product is jewelry, preserve gemstone count, gemstone placement, stone shapes, prong settings, metal framework, connectors, closures, and all structural details exactly. Emphasize gemstone clarity, metal texture, craftsmanship, luxury detail, and premium finish. The final image must be sharp, realistic, refined, high-definition, visually 4K-quality, and look like a premium international luxury brand model-wearing campaign image with accurate product scale, preserved design, strong atmosphere, and high purchase appeal. Do not redesign the product. Do not distort the structure. Do not change the product proportions. Do not create incorrect wearing scale. Do not enlarge jewelry to make it more dramatic. Do not hide product details. Do not make the result look generic, cheap, awkward, or low-end.。\"}",
